## Edition (3 + Future)

| Edition | 목적 | Repository |
|---------|------|------------|
| **Quality (QMS Only)** | 순수 품질 · 입출고/생산 ❌ | Session · CSV/Excel |
| **Standalone (QMS + Basic)** | 운영+품질 통합 | Session → SQLite |
| **MES Connected (QMS + MES)** | MES SoT · TITAN QMS · Read Only | Oracle / API / CSV |
| **Enterprise** | Future · Smart Factory | ERP·PLC·IoT·AI·SPC |

